{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "oficina-fase2-v2",
    "name": "Oficina Mecânica — Fase 2 — Fluxo Completo",
    "description": "Cobertura completa do fluxo da Fase 2: Happy Path, Fluxo de Recusa, Relatórios e Estoque.\n\n▶️ COMO USAR:\n1. Execute '0.1 Login' — o token JWT é salvo automaticamente\n2. Execute o Setup completo (pastas 1 e 2)\n3. Siga os fluxos na ordem das pastas\n\nVariáveis capturadas automaticamente via test scripts: token, servicoId, servico2Id, pecaId, peca2Id, atendenteId, clienteId, veiculoId, osId, osNumero, os2Id, os2Numero, itemServicoId, itemPecaId",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl",      "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token",        "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "servicoId",    "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "servico2Id",   "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "pecaId",       "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "peca2Id",      "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "atendenteId",  "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "clienteId",    "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "veiculoId",    "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "osId",         "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "osNumero",     "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "os2Id",        "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "os2Numero",    "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "itemServicoId","value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "itemPecaId",   "value": "",                      "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [

    {
      "name": "0. Autenticação",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "0.1 Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token);",
                  "    console.log('Token JWT salvo:', json.token);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"login\": \"admin\",\n  \"senha\": \"admin123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },

